    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-31T15:55:15+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-31T15:55:15+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T05:25:15Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T05:25:15Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system over central districts moves eastwards in Victoria overnight. A low pressure system is expected to enter from the west on Sunday, moving over central and eastern districts on Monday, followed by another ridge of high pressure which will persist until Tuesday. On Wednesday a cold front moves over the south of the state.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW004" description="Upper South East" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-31T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Slight chance of a shower south of Keith, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds westerly 25 to 35 km/h decreasing to 15 to 25 km/h in the evening then becoming west to southwesterly and light in the late evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of fog in the early morning. High chance of showers, most likely in the evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the evening. Light winds becoming west to northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day then becoming light in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 9 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">No Rating</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the early morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Winds easterly 15 to 20 km/h shifting southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the late morning. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-05T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-04T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Winds west to northwesterly 20 to 30 km/h turning southwesterly 30 to 45 km/h during the day then decreasing to 25 to 35 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching around 20.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
